                                "sense_id": "8ce81951-597d-3c60-b588-c9b35aba4773",
                                "text": "And both against the Peace of Heauen, and him,\nHaue here vp-swarmed them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f04d7a32-4f2e-445e-83e8-e3dcfa6cd8dd",
                                "sense_id": "8ce81951-597d-3c60-b588-c9b35aba4773",
                                "text": "Such was his exhortation; they his voice\nAll hearing, with close-order'd ranks direct\nBore on the barrier, and upswarming show'd\nOn the high battlement their glittering spears"
